OL,5,G0155 Who Killed Billie-Jo?
OL,6,     FIn 1997, Sion Jenkins was
OL,7,     Fconvicted of murdering his
OL,8,     Ffoster-daughter, Billie-Jo. After
OL,9,     Fserving six years of a life
OL,10,     Fsentence, he was acquitted and
OL,11,     Freleased from prison.
